{"seq":3,"slug":"cherry-pick-and-revert","title":"精选与回退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/cherry-pick-and-revert","wordCount":747,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"精选与回退\">精选与回退</h1><h2 id=\"三种撤销策略概览\">三种撤销策略概览</h2><p>Git 提供三种不同层次的撤销手段，它们的安全性和适用场景各不相同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>是否改写历史</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>git revert</code></td>\n<td>创建反向提交</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>已推送的公共分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git reset</code></td>\n<td>移动分支指针</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>本地未推送的提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git cherry-pick</code></td>\n<td>复制提交</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>从其他分支提取提交</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>撤销与移植的核心，是判断&quot;是否改写历史&quot;以及&quot;操作对象是提交还是指针&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>改写历史</td>\n<td>是否重写已有提交，决定能否用于公共分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cherry-Pick</td>\n<td>复制指定提交到当前分支，生成新 SHA-1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Revert</td>\n<td>创建反向提交撤销更改，不改写历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reset</td>\n<td>移动分支指针，有 soft/mixed/hard 三种粒度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ref 代数</td>\n<td>用 HEAD~n、HEAD@{n} 等表达式定位提交</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"cherry-pick-精选提取\">Cherry-Pick 精选提取</h2><p><strong>Cherry-Pick</strong> 将指定的一个或多个提交应用到当前分支，生成新的 commit（新的 SHA-1）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git cherry-pick abc1234&#10;&#10;git cherry-pick abc1234 def5678 ghi9012&#10;&#10;git cherry-pick abc1234..def5678&#10;&#10;git cherry-pick -n abc1234&#10;git cherry-pick --no-commit abc1234\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cherry-pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> abc1234</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cherry-pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> abc1234</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> def5678</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ghi9012</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cherry-pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> abc1234..def5678</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cherry-pick</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> abc1234</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cherry-pick</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no-commit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> abc1234</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"unknown\" data-source=\"gitGraph&#10;    commit id: &quot;A&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;B&quot;&#10;    branch feature&#10;    commit id: &quot;C&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;D&quot; type: HIGHLIGHT&#10;    commit id: &quot;E&quot;&#10;    checkout main&#10;    commit id: &quot;F&quot;&#10;    cherry-pick id: &quot;D&quot;\">gitGraph\n    commit id: \"A\"\n    commit id: \"B\"\n    branch feature\n    commit id: \"C\"\n    commit id: \"D\" type: HIGHLIGHT\n    commit id: \"E\"\n    checkout main\n    commit id: \"F\"\n    cherry-pick id: \"D\"</pre><p>处理 cherry-pick 冲突：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git cherry-pick abc1234&#10;# CONFLICT...&#10;vi conflicted-file.sh&#10;git add conflicted-file.sh&#10;git cherry-pick --continue&#10;&#10;git cherry-pick --abort\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cherry-pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> abc1234</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CONFLICT...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> conflicted-file.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> conflicted-file.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cherry-pick</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cherry-pick</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --abort</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> cherry-pick 生成的是全新 commit，与原提交有不同的 SHA-1。如果后续需要合并原分支，可能产生重复更改。建议记录 cherry-pick 来源。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-revert-安全回退\">Git Revert 安全回退</h2><p><strong>Revert</strong> 创建一个新的提交来撤销指定提交的更改，不改写历史：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git revert abc1234&#10;&#10;git revert HEAD&#10;&#10;git revert abc1234..def5678&#10;&#10;git revert -n abc1234\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> revert</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> abc1234</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> revert</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> revert</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> abc1234..def5678</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> revert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> abc1234</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"unknown\" data-source=\"gitGraph&#10;    commit id: &quot;A&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;B&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;C (bug)&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;D&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;Revert C&quot; type: HIGHLIGHT\">gitGraph\n    commit id: \"A\"\n    commit id: \"B\"\n    commit id: \"C (bug)\"\n    commit id: \"D\"\n    commit id: \"Revert C\" type: HIGHLIGHT</pre><p>回退合并提交需要指定保留的 parent：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git revert -m 1 &lt;merge-commit-hash&gt;&#10;&#10;git log --oneline --graph\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> revert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">merge-commit-has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">h</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --oneline</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --graph</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><code>-m</code> 值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>保留第一个 parent（主分支）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>保留第二个 parent（功能分支）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> revert 合并提交后，如果后续需要重新合并同一分支，需要先 revert 那个 revert commit，否则 Git 会认为该分支的更改已经存在。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-reset-三种模式\">Git Reset 三种模式</h2><p><strong>Reset</strong> 通过移动 HEAD 和分支指针来&quot;撤销&quot;提交，有三种模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>HEAD</th>\n<th>暂存区</th>\n<th>工作目录</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>--soft</code></td>\n<td>移动</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>重新组织提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--mixed</code></td>\n<td>移动</td>\n<td>重置</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>取消暂存（默认模式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--hard</code></td>\n<td>移动</td>\n<td>重置</td>\n<td>重置</td>\n<td>完全丢弃更改</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git reset --soft HEAD~1&#10;git reset --mixed HEAD~1&#10;git reset --hard HEAD~1&#10;&#10;git reset HEAD -- src/config.sh&#10;&#10;git reflog&#10;git reset --hard HEAD@{2}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reset</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --soft</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD~1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reset</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --mixed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD~1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reset</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --hard</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD~1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reset</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reflog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reset</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --hard</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD@{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[git reset --soft] --&gt;|HEAD 移动| B[暂存区保留, 工作区保留]&#10;    C[git reset --mixed] --&gt;|HEAD 移动| D[暂存区重置, 工作区保留]&#10;    E[git reset --hard] --&gt;|HEAD 移动| F[暂存区重置, 工作区重置]\">graph TD\n    A[git reset --soft] --&gt;|HEAD 移动| B[暂存区保留, 工作区保留]\n    C[git reset --mixed] --&gt;|HEAD 移动| D[暂存区重置, 工作区保留]\n    E[git reset --hard] --&gt;|HEAD 移动| F[暂存区重置, 工作区重置]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>git reset --hard</code> 是破坏性操作，会丢失工作目录中未提交的更改。执行前务必确认，或先用 <code>git stash</code> 保存当前工作。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"三者对比与选择\">三者对比与选择</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{提交已推送?} --&gt;|是| B[git revert]&#10;    A --&gt;|否| C{要保留更改?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[git reset --soft]&#10;    C --&gt;|部分保留| E[git reset --mixed]&#10;    C --&gt;|不保留| F[git reset --hard]&#10;    G{从其他分支取提交?} --&gt; H[git cherry-pick]\">graph TD\n    A{提交已推送?} --&gt;|是| B[git revert]\n    A --&gt;|否| C{要保留更改?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[git reset --soft]\n    C --&gt;|部分保留| E[git reset --mixed]\n    C --&gt;|不保留| F[git reset --hard]\n    G{从其他分支取提交?} --&gt; H[git cherry-pick]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐命令</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>撤销已推送的 bug 修复</td>\n<td><code>git revert &lt;hash&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并了一个提交但需要取消合并</td>\n<td><code>git revert -m 1 &lt;hash&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地提交写错了想重写</td>\n<td><code>git reset --soft HEAD~1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完全丢弃最近 3 个本地提交</td>\n<td><code>git reset --hard HEAD~3</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把 hotfix 分支的修复拿过来</td>\n<td><code>git cherry-pick &lt;hash&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只想取消暂存，保留文件修改</td>\n<td><code>git reset HEAD -- &lt;file&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实战场景\">实战场景</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 场景 1：撤销最近一次推送的提交&#10;git revert HEAD&#10;git push origin main&#10;&#10;# 场景 2：将最近 3 个提交合并为 1 个&#10;git reset --soft HEAD~3&#10;git commit -m &quot;feat: complete user auth module&quot;&#10;&#10;# 场景 3：从 release 分支提取紧急修复&#10;git checkout main&#10;git cherry-pick release/v1.2..release/v1.2.1&#10;&#10;# 场景 4：误操作恢复&#10;git reflog&#10;git reset --hard HEAD@{1}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 场景 1：撤销最近一次推送的提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> revert</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 场景 2：将最近 3 个提交合并为 1 个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reset</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --soft</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD~3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat: complete user auth module\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 场景 3：从 release 分支提取紧急修复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cherry-pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> release/v1.2..release/v1.2.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 场景 4：误操作恢复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reflog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reset</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --hard</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD@{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((精选与回退))&#10;    Cherry-Pick&#10;      精确提取提交&#10;      新 SHA-1&#10;      -n 不自动提交&#10;    Revert&#10;      反向提交&#10;      不改写历史&#10;      -m 合并回退&#10;    Reset&#10;      --soft 保留全部&#10;      --mixed 重置暂存&#10;      --hard 全部重置&#10;    选择原则&#10;      已推送用 revert&#10;      未推送用 reset&#10;      跨分支用 cherry-pick\">mindmap\n  root((精选与回退))\n    Cherry-Pick\n      精确提取提交\n      新 SHA-1\n      -n 不自动提交\n    Revert\n      反向提交\n      不改写历史\n      -m 合并回退\n    Reset\n      --soft 保留全部\n      --mixed 重置暂存\n      --hard 全部重置\n    选择原则\n      已推送用 revert\n      未推送用 reset\n      跨分支用 cherry-pick</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Cherry-pick</strong> 从任意分支精确提取提交，生成新 commit，适合 hotfix 移植</li>\n<li><strong>Revert</strong> 通过反向提交安全撤销更改，不改写历史，是公共分支的首选撤销方式</li>\n<li><strong>Reset</strong> 提供 soft/mixed/hard 三种级别的回退，仅适用于未推送的本地提交</li>\n<li>选择原则：<strong>已推送用 revert，未推送用 reset，跨分支用 cherry-pick</strong></li>\n<li>误操作后 <strong>reflog</strong> 是恢复的最后防线，几乎任何操作都可以通过 reflog 回退</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"精选与回退","id":"精选与回退"},{"level":2,"text":"三种撤销策略概览","id":"三种撤销策略概览"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Cherry-Pick 精选提取","id":"cherry-pick-精选提取"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Revert 安全回退","id":"git-revert-安全回退"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Reset 三种模式","id":"git-reset-三种模式"},{"level":2,"text":"三者对比与选择","id":"三者对比与选择"},{"level":2,"text":"实战场景","id":"实战场景"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"二分法与追溯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/bisect-and-blame"},"next":{"title":"历史重写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/filter-and-rewrite"}}